1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,600
[MUSIC]

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:07,910
Welcome back. Today we're sharing one video
with a team of 12 people.

3
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:12,330
First, upload the file. It's 2.4 GB,
so give it a minute.

4
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:14,830
<i>While that runs, set the title.</i>

5
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:17,100
Keep it under 60 characters.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,370
Next, pick who can watch it.

7
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:23,790
- Everyone on the team?
- Only the 12 people on the list.

8
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,580
Right, so we choose "Private link".

9
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,220
Now add subtitles in 3 languages.

10
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:33,860
Italian, Spanish and German are ready
from the last project.

11
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:38,500
The translation takes about 2 minutes
for a 10-minute video.

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,290
Check every cue before you publish.

13
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:45,710
A wrong number in a subtitle is worse
than a missing one.

14
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:49,380
For example, "1,200 downloads" must
stay "1,200 downloads".

15
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:51,950
<i>Dates matter too: March 3, 2027.</i>

16
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:56,150
If a line is too long, it won't fit
on a phone screen.

17
00:00:56,350 --> 00:00:59,110
Two lines, 42 characters each,
is a good limit.

18
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,530
Reading speed matters as well.

19
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:04,260
People read about 17 characters
per second.

20
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:06,980
Anything faster feels like a blur.

21
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,780
[applause]

22
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:10,580
Now press Publish.

23
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,710
The link works right away.

24
00:01:12,910 --> 00:01:15,720
Send it to the team on Monday at 9:30.

25
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:17,920
You'll see views within 5 minutes.

26
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:21,010
If someone can't watch, check the list.

27
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:23,880
Each person needs their own account.

28
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:28,670
- Can I share it outside the team?
- Yes, but only for 7 days.

29
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:31,750
That limit is the default,
and you can change it.

30
00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:33,950
<i>We keep a copy for 30 days.</i>

31
00:01:34,150 --> 00:01:36,390
After that, we ask before deleting it.

32
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:38,740
One last thing: the captions.

33
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:41,610
Download them as a file if you like.

34
00:01:41,810 --> 00:01:45,220
The file is plain text with numbers
and times.

35
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:47,420
Edit it in any text editor.

36
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:50,580
Just don't change the times by accident.

37
00:01:50,780 --> 00:01:52,380
That's all for today.

38
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:56,210
Thanks for watching, and see you
in the next one.

39
00:01:56,410 --> 00:01:58,010
[MUSIC]
